{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lose everything to debt. Survive the streets \u2014 or be consumed by them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve lost your job. Your possessions have been seized. With nothing left, you must start over \u2014 from the streets.<br>Beg for spare change, sell small items, and scrape together enough money to pay off your crushing debt.<br>But beware \u2014 miss a single payment, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, interact with strangers in traffic and on the sidewalks \u2014 some will help, some will ignore you, and others will lash out.<br>At night, return to your broken shelter: rest, store your belongings, and slowly turn your rundown shack into a place of safety and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters. Can you manage your money wisely, stay safe from thieves, and keep your morale high?<br>Or will the streets take everything from you once again?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you experience the beginning of <i>Street Life Simulator</i> \u2014 a taste of survival on the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through one full in-game day</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beg and sell basic items</strong> to earn money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>day-night cycle</strong> as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>hunger, energy, and hygiene</strong> levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your shelter</strong> and prepare for the challenges ahead</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-driven NPC dialogue system</strong> with dynamic reactions\u00a0<i>(available only in the full game)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theft system</strong> that introduces risk and tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story progression and long-term debt repayment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version expands the world with AI-powered interactions, deeper survival systems, and long-term progression as you rise\u2014or fall\u2014on the streets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095410?t=1760971520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095410/1e617919dfd1f75ab39527395454a66170da35d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760971520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095410/146286c8b495d2c90462adaff2f61c2e2ab4a7f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760971520","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095410/146286c8b495d2c90462adaff2f61c2e2ab4a7f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760971520","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lose everything to debt. Survive the streets \u2014 or be consumed by them.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve lost your job. Your possessions have been seized. With nothing left, you must start over \u2014 from the streets.<br>Beg for spare change, sell small items, and scrape together enough money to pay off your crushing debt.<br>But beware \u2014 miss a single payment, and it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the day, interact with strangers in traffic and on the sidewalks \u2014 some will help, some will ignore you, and others will lash out.<br>At night, return to your broken shelter: rest, store your belongings, and slowly turn your rundown shack into a place of safety and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters. Can you manage your money wisely, stay safe from thieves, and keep your morale high?<br>Or will the streets take everything from you once again?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you experience the beginning of <i>Street Life Simulator</i> \u2014 a taste of survival on the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play through one full in-game day</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beg and sell basic items</strong> to earn money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>day-night cycle</strong> as time passes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your <strong>hunger, energy, and hygiene</strong> levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your shelter</strong> and prepare for the challenges ahead</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not included in the demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-driven NPC dialogue system</strong> with dynamic reactions\u00a0<i>(available only in the full game)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theft system</strong> that introduces risk and tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story progression and long-term debt repayment</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version expands the world with AI-powered interactions, deeper survival systems, and long-term progression as you rise\u2014or fall\u2014on the streets.</p>","developers":["Eloy Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3972530","name":"Street Life Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095410/d78d062606b817a11f428739a1d1c8195a79e7e4/header.jpg?t=1760971520","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"das